<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>openfirma — third-party licences</title>
<style>
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { background: #333; color: white; }
    a { color: skyblue; }
  }
  .container { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .intro { text-align: center; }
  .license-text { max-height: 320px; overflow-y: scroll; white-space: pre-wrap; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="container">
  <div class="intro">
    <h1>openfirma — third-party licences</h1>
    <p>Every crate this binary statically links, its licence, and the licence
    text with the copyright notices it requires you to receive. openfirma
    itself is GPL-2.0-or-later OR EUPL-1.1 (see LICENSES/), and openfirma's
    relationship with AutoFirma is in NOTICE.md.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Components:</h2>
  <table>
  {{#each crates}}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{{#if package.repository}} {{package.repository}} {{else}} https://crates.io/crates/{{package.name}} {{/if}}">{{package.name}}</a></td>
      <td>{{package.version}}</td>
      <td>{{license}}</td>
    </tr>
  {{/each}}
  </table>

  <h2>Licence texts:</h2>
  {{#each overview}}
    <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
    <pre class="license-text">{{text}}</pre>
  {{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
